@startuml seq-feedback
title Prospect sign-in, feedback, and "I need more time"

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor Prospect
participant "Cloudflare Access" as Access
participant "portal-ui" as UI
participant "portal-api" as PAPI
database "portal D1" as PDB
participant "admin-api" as AAPI
database "system D1" as SDB
participant "Cloudflare API" as CF
actor Ed

== Sign-in (same flow for the glimpse hostname) ==
Prospect -> Access : GET portal.glimpse.andexor.net\n(one Access app covers / and /api/*)
Access --> Prospect : login page (OTP)
Prospect -> Access : email
Access -> Access : email on policy? → send PIN\n(from noreply@notify.cloudflare.com)
Prospect -> Access : PIN
Access --> Prospect : session cookie (7 days,\nshared across Access apps)
Prospect -> UI : portal page
UI -> PAPI : GET /api/v1/me/glimpses\n(Cf-Access-Jwt-Assertion header)
PAPI -> PAPI : verify JWT, read email claim
PAPI -> PDB : SELECT prospect by email;\nSELECT glimpse WHERE prospect_id
PAPI --> UI : [{ id, company, hostname,\nexpires_at, active, current_decision }]

== Approve / Decline ==
Prospect -> UI : Approve (confirm)
UI -> PAPI : POST /api/v1/glimpses/{id}/decision { action: APPROVED }
PAPI -> PDB : INSERT decision_log (APPROVED)
PAPI -> AAPI : record_decision(glimpse_id, APPROVED)   [Service Binding]
AAPI -> SDB : UPDATE glimpse state=APPROVED\nINSERT glimpse_event PENDING→APPROVED (actor=PROSPECT)
PAPI -> PDB : INSERT notification ed feedback_alert (stub)
PAPI --> Ed : email + SMS (stub)
PAPI --> UI : 201 { action: APPROVED, occurred_at }

== Comment ==
Prospect -> UI : Add comment
UI -> PAPI : POST /api/v1/glimpses/{id}/comments { body }
PAPI -> PDB : INSERT comment
PAPI --> Ed : email + SMS (stub)
PAPI --> UI : 201

== "I need more time" (self-service, no approval) ==
Prospect -> UI : I need more time
UI -> PAPI : POST /api/v1/glimpses/{id}/extend
PAPI -> AAPI : extend(glimpse_id)   [Service Binding]
AAPI -> SDB : state=DELAYED; activated_at=now, expires_at=+7d, delete_at=+30d\ncancel pending jobs; INSERT new EXPIRE+DELETE\nextension_count+1; INSERT glimpse_event (actor=PROSPECT)
AAPI -> CF : if EXPIRED: re-add prospect to the Access policy
AAPI -> PAPI : upsert_glimpse(expires_at, active=true)   [Service Binding]
AAPI --> PAPI : { expires_at, delete_at }
PAPI -> PDB : INSERT decision_log (DELAYED, new_expires_at)
PAPI -> PDB : INSERT notification ed extension_taken,\nprospect extension_confirmation (stubs)
PAPI --> Ed : email + SMS (stub)
PAPI --> UI : 200 { expires_at }
UI --> Prospect : new expiry shown

== Ed views feedback in admin-ui (on demand, nothing stored) ==
Ed -> AAPI : GET /api/v1/glimpses/{id}
AAPI -> SDB : SELECT glimpse
AAPI -> PAPI : get_feedback(glimpse_id)   [Service Binding]
PAPI -> PDB : SELECT decision_log, comment
PAPI --> AAPI : { decisions[], comments[] }
AAPI --> Ed : glimpse + feedback
@enduml
